:"世話焼きで涙もろく、実はいいお嫁さんになれるタイプだったり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分を特別扱いしない主人公に、心地よいスタンスを感じているのも確か。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"63919"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5c/5c658c0b5b17e1874c4374e95e9a27ba7b8bba2aca18f83f9f29870733b899b2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/62/62df80a932cf54c432569a84b0d1b6f6bb480aaa26518495b6c8b580e5f71b0f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"青葉りんご","creatorId":"vndb:s295","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s295","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s295","name":"青葉 りんご","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:198761:63919:5922:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c49700","characterName":"矢吹 由貴","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"63921","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"198761"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16373"],"vndbCharacterId":"c49700"},"originalCharacterName":"矢吹 由貴","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A former student model now a member of the idol unit \"Charm\" and Yura's older twin sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Since they were young she has always been bullying and tormenting Yura but she in fact has a huge brother complex. Because she didn't want to go too far and become hated by him she left home and became an idol to put distance between them."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c49700"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"セクシーアイドルユニット「チャーム」のメンバー。主人公の双子の姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"面白そうなら取り合えず飛びつく快楽主義者。アイドルの仕事でさえも最近飽き気味。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「趣味は弟いじり」を公言し悪戯や意地悪を繰り返すが、これは愛情の裏返し。"},{"spoiler":false,"tex